WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.360
An enemy in the real world?!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.440
Is that... an enemy?

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.630
What is that?

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.270
That thing is...

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:35.100
With this, everyone present here will
become one with the Shinju-sama,

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.050
and be welcomed into the family of the gods.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.560
What a truly joyous thing.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.750
This is your final duty:

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.190
Repel the enemy's attacks until
the Shinkon is completed.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:54.200
We'll do it, but we'll take
Yuuna back as well!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.200
We won't allow the Shinkon to happen!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.560
This is bad!

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.620
The Heavenly Gods...

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:41.030
If my life is going to end anyway...

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.530
If my life can be used to save others...

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.050
I'm not afraid...

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:49.790
I'm not afraid!

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:55.520
That thing's crazy!

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.790
Fuu!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.130
Karin!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.450
You guys go on ahead to where Yuuna is!

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.610
I'll go and fight this thing back!

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.100
<i>You'll</i> fight that thing back?!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.640
Don't underestimate me.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.250
I can still use my Mankai!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.220
Karin!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:18.050
<i>I also need to apologize to Yuuna.</i>

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.230
<i>We're going back together!</i>

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.070
I'm the peerless Miyoshi Karin!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:29.040
Witness me as I go on a once-in-a-lifetime rampage!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:46.260
We won't...

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.840
Onee-chan? You know, I...

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:51.390
Itsuki, can I leave this to you?

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:53.860
Yeah.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:56.020
Please head over to where Yuuna-san is!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.780
Yeah! I'll bring her back.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:00.530
Make sure you stay safe!

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.980
Okay!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:10.140
Fuu-senpai, please get on!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:11.240
Tougou!

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.490
Right, let's head over
to where Yuuna is!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:17.380
We'll go there at flank speed!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.510
The barrier!

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.340
This thing is behind it all...

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:31.560
To hell with you!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.810
Why you!

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.280
Sonoko!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.660
You shouldn't go too far ahead
by yourself, Nibosshi!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.620
Itsuki!

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.200
Let's protect everyone!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.710
Let's defend this place - all of us together,
until Yuuna-san comes back!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.340
Tougou, over there!

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:06.090
It leads to the Shinju-sama...

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.970
Yuuna should be up ahead!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:13.310
What's that?

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.770
It's just one thing after another!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.650
Fuu-senpai...

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.620
All hands, abandon ship!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.170
Tougou...

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.390
The Shinju-sama is blocking our path!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.140
Like I care!

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.950
Even if it's the Shinju-sama...

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:01.980
This is the only time I won't back down!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.470
The path!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.740
That's...

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.230
Tougou, can you do it?

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.790
Without fail.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.040
Then,

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.550
I'll just...

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.300
cut open...

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.800
a path!

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.870
Just what is...

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.290
this place?

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:49.130
Will I be able to make it back
with my fairy's power?

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:11.230
Yuuna-chan!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:15.490
Tougou-san... why?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.410
Let's go home, Yuuna-chan!

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:18.870
I've come to take you back!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.290
To go this far trying to stop me...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.040
You don't want to give her up, do you?

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:33.010
Yuuna-chan, I'll save you now!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.650
But I...

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.010
If I don't do this...

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.010
The world will end!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:46.270
If someone has to do this, then I...

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:50.020
Nobody has to do this, not even you, Yuuna-chan!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:54.780
I don't want to lose anyone precious to me ever again!

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:59.870
If I endure this, it will be fine-

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:00.870
Yuuna!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.080
Please tell me the truth.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.410
If you're scared,
then tell me so.

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:11.250
If we really are friends...

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.750
then call on me to save you!

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:22.590
I don't want this...

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.860
I'm scared...

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:28.420
but I can't say it...

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:32.840
But... I don't want to die!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:38.280
I don't want to be separated from everyone!

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:41.030
Yuuna-chan...

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:45.020
All of us gave our best...

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.370
So, why...

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:50.880
I don't want this...

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:55.130
I...

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.090
I want to stay with everyone forever!

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.050
Yuuna-chan! Give me your hand!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.680
Tougou-san, save me!

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.330
Yuuna-chan!

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.850
Tougou-san!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:26.210
No way! Even now, it still...

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:31.460
Tougou-san! Save... me...

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.000
Yuuna-chan!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.500
Tougou-sa-

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.260
No!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.780
This isn't right...

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:04.530
We shouldn't be doing this.

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:13.290
I <i>am</i> grateful, but...

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.000
But...

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.250
Enough of this.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:25.720
A world we can only keep by sacrificing others, even our friends -

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.850
I don't want...

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.680
a world like this.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.500
That's...

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.900
<i>Shinju-sama...</i>

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:22.780
<i>There are many kinds of people.</i>

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:27.530
<i>But if you really want to save us...</i>

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.280
Then please,

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:35.540
won't you believe in mankind?

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.070
We...

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:12.200
will tread our path as humans.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.430
Yuuna-chan!

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:37.640
Tougou-san...

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.150
Yuuna-chan!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:42.640
Tougou-sa-

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.010
Tougou-san!

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.120
I'm sorry...

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.030
I'm sorry, I said too much...

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.360
I'm...

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:54.320
I'm also sorry!

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:58.130
I did something horrible to you... to everyone!

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.340
It's fine.

00:14:59.340 --> 00:15:00.940
It's fine now.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.460
What do we do?

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.680
The world...

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:06.410
The world is gonna end!

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.550
It's not your fault, Yuuna-chan.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:13.180
Even if the world ends now,

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.930
we can't do anything about it anymore.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.050
Gyuuki...

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.900
What are you...?

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.290
It's okay.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:40.350
It's so warm...

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.810
I...

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.580
We will...

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:27.210
fight as humans.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.380
We want to live!

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:49.530
Heroes never yield!

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.530
No matter how often we fall,
we'll always get back up!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.320
Go, Yuuna!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.780
For Yuuna-san's happiness!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.490
You're likely to succeed...

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:00.200
if you try!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.410
Hero Club!

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:08.970
Go!

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:27.440
Heroes are about guts!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:35.650
He

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:36.920
ro
He

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:40.490
Punch!
ro
He

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:23.690
The flames are...

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.000
This is...

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.750
different from usual.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:07.540
Gyuuki, you're...

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.300
Thank you.

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:22.800
Goodbye.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:44.540
We... made it back.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.160
The world's...

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.660
still here.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:51.670
The Shinju-sama is...

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:54.240
gone?

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.920
Did it sange?

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.860
It's the usual sky.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.770
What's wrong, Yuuna-chan?

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.190
Are you hurt?

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:18.440
It's gone...

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.780
The mark is gone?

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:24.450
Everyone...

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.660
I'm sorry, everyone!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.200
Me too.

00:20:32.510 --> 00:20:33.920
I'm so sorry.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.670
Karin-chan!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:44.000
Welcome back, Yuuna.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.790
I'm back!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:05.450
The large-scale fire stretching from the inland mountains into the city area...

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.620
The prolonged stay in the shelters is causing worsening fatigue among the residents.
has spread across 10,000 hectares within the course of a week.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:09.000
The Taisha has yet to address any future corrective actions that should be implemented.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.540
In other words, the Taisha knew what was outside the wall all this time?

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.610
Take a look!

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:13.180
The mainland is in ruins, completely in ruins! There are no signs of human life!

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:15.920
From now on, mankind may have to work out
a way to survive on limited resources.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.760
According to one theory, the gushing oil may be the remains of the Shinju-sama.

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:21.240
The children are innocent.

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.970
The Gods of the Land are gone.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:30.340
Now that we're no longer under the gods' protection,
mankind must learn to survive on limited resources.

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:32.470
There will be chaos.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:36.920
But this is fine.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:41.980
I am proud of the decision
those girls made.

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:47.720
This new era will be for the sake of the children.

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:50.990
The adults will need to take responsibility.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:53.730
This is how it must be.

00:21:57.880 --> 00:22:01.050
The Hero Club is back to being the Hero Club!

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:03.640
Fuu-senpai got accepted into high school.

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:08.220
And who would have thought Itsuki-chan
would be the new club president!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:10.480
We'll do our best today.

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:13.180
Without pushing ourselves, of course.

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.380
If we do that,

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:16.630
our future will be bright,

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:18.730
and all the things we think back on...

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:22.170
will be wonderful.

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:24.140
Because everyone's here.

00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:26.740
Because all of them were here for me.

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:28.830
Because I love all of them.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:33.400
I'm really glad to be part
of the Hero Club!

00:22:34.740 --> 00:22:38.750
Right, this is...
